    {
      "heading": "Q1. Factorise by grouping terms:",
      "content": "ax + bx - ay - by\n= x(a + b) - y(a + b)\n= (a + b)(x - y)"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Q2. Factorise the quadratic expression (Middle Term Splitting):",
      "content": "x² + 9x + 20\n= x² + 5x + 4x + 20\n= x(x + 5) + 4(x + 5)\n= (x + 5)(x + 4)"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Q3. Factorise using Difference of Two Squares:",
      "content": "49x² - 64y²\n= (7x)² - (8y)²\n= (7x - 8y)(7x + 8y)"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Q4. Common Binomial Factor:",
      "content": "3x(x - 4) - 2(x - 4)\n= (x - 4)(3x - 2)"
    }
